  "name": "open-collaboration-tools",
  "description": "A comprehensive suite of libraries and IDE extensions enabling real-time remote collaboration via a specialized communication protocol. It utilizes Yjs-based CRDTs for shared state consistency and incorporates built-in support for message encryption, compression, and transport-agnostic socket layers. The project provides a reference server implementation and a VS Code extension that mirrors workspaces, synchronizes cursors, and tracks user selections across distributed environments.",
